        <description>Hebrew transcription and English translation of John from Biblioteca Apostolica Vaticana ebr. 530, part 1, fragment 11, folios 1r–2v, a manuscript held by the Vatican Library. Transcribed, translated, and annotated by Nehemia Gordon.</description>
